        "readable_text": "Prompt:\n[MATH: (root(5, 3))/(root(7, 3)) =]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: root(35, 3)]\nb. [MATH: root((25)/(49), 3)]\nc. [MATH: root((5)/(7), 3)]\nd. [MATH: (5)/(root(7, 3))]\ne. [MATH: (root(5, 3))/(7)]"
